'''Winter Veil Vale''' is a magical realm that manifests among the snowy peaks of [[Dun Morogh]] around the time of Winter Veil.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20260408150640/https://forum.turtlecraft.gg/viewtopic.php?t=854 Winter's Veil 2019]</ref> It is the home of furbolgs, snowmen, winter grells and yetis, and welcomes denizens and revelers of all races of Azeroth to celebrate the holiday of Winter Veil.

